# Starfall Crater -- a meteor crater in the mountains (22x20 blocks = 44x40 steps)
#
# Pitch: a narrow canyon (S exit) opens into a round bowl ringed by cliffs. It is built
# from the plateau grammar: 72 north face, 69/68 inner sides, 70 south lip, 6f/6e inner
# corners, 6b/6a canyon corners. The floor is in rings: tall grass under the rim, then
# short grass, then a scorched dirt ring, then a crater lake. In the middle of the lake
# a meteorite (boulder 0a) sits on a flowered islet. A cave mouth in the north face (73)
# leads to an optional "Meteor Hollow" cave. A ledge band below the cave terrace makes a
# one-way drop back to the lake; the way up is the west dirt lane past a Hiker.
# Hook: the islet holds ONE static encounter (Surf needed). Make it night-only or
#   season-gated: a single legendary, or Clefable on a full-moon night (Clefairy in the
#   rim grass at night). The Meteorite rock is a bg_event ("still warm...").
# Trainers: Hiker (west lane), Psychic (dirt ring, NE), Super Nerd/astronomer (S ring).
# Items: terrace item by the cave, hidden shard on the islet, two hidden items in the
#   rim grass.
# Exits: S (20,39) canyon; CAVE warp (28,5); islet (19,20) by Surf only.
# Attach: off Route 42/Mt. Mortar's high country (Hearthhollow's south stub) or Route 45.
ref Route42
key M=71 F=72 W=69 E=68 L=70 q=6f p=6e Y=6b Z=6a V=71
grid:
MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM
MMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM
